The decks by Reiji Kitsuoka that come with TarotTerminal (Baroque, Dark Fantasy,
Etching, HD, Mystical, Pastel, Steampunk, Synthwave, Ukiyoe and Vibrant):
Base  imagery was AI-generated (Wombo Dream). Frames, glyphs, card layout and
digital editing are by Reiji Kitsuoka and are licensed under the Creative Commons 
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Credit: "Decks by Reiji Kitsuoka (Sasazaki Software)".

The "Rider Waite (LuciellaES)" deck is Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett's, released
under CC0: https://luciellaes.itch.io/rider-waite-smith-tarot-cards-cc0

TarotTerminal is built with the Godot Engine (https://godotengine.org), which is
licensed under the MIT License; see Settings -> Licenses in the app for the
engine's license and those of the libraries it includes.
